Description: soundboard that plays sounds into your calls
 Vinheta is a soundboard for the GNOME desktop. Each folder added by the
 user becomes a tab with a pad per sound, played with a click or a key.
 .
 Sounds are played on the audio output and are also sent to a virtual
 microphone named "Vinheta", together with the voice of the user, so that
 other people hear them in calls.
